# =============================================================================
# Team Shoutout Board — Environment Variable Template
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (local dev) and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit `.env.local` or any file containing real secrets.
#
# Two runtimes read env vars differently:
#   - Frontend (Vite): only vars prefixed VITE_ are exposed to browser code.
#   - Edge Function (Deno): reads via `Deno.env.get(...)`, injected by the
#     Supabase platform in production (`supabase secrets set`), or from
#     --env-file .env.local when running `supabase functions serve` locally.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend (Vite) — safe to expose to the browser
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local Supabase API URL. Printed by `supabase start`; defaults to this value
# for the standard local stack. Points at your deployed project URL in prod.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321

# Anonymous/public API key — RLS-enforced, safe to expose to the client.
# Printed by `supabase start` for local dev.
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-local-anon-key

# Base URL for Edge Functions, used by src/lib/api.ts. Local functions are
# served under /functions/v1 off the same API port as VITE_SUPABASE_URL.
VITE_SUPABASE_FUNCTIONS_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Edge Function (Deno) — SERVER-ONLY, never prefix with VITE_
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase project URL, read via Deno.env.get("SUPABASE_URL"). Supabase
# injects this automatically for deployed functions; set it in .env.local
# for `supabase functions serve`.
SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321

# Service-role key — bypasses Row Level Security. Used by the `shoutouts`
# Edge Function to insert/select. NEVER expose this to the frontend bundle,
# never log it, never return it in an API response.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-local-service-role-key

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CI / Test Only
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Base URL the frontend build/dev server runs at, used by any local
# smoke-test scripts.
E2E_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5173
